This licence covers the miRPanel source code only.

The reference database distributed with miRPanel releases, and included in
the Docker image, contains data derived from resources published by others:
MANE (NCBI and EMBL-EBI), Ensembl, miRBase, TargetScan and miRTarBase. Each
remains under its own terms of use, which apply to you as they would to any
other user of that resource. Please cite the original resources in any work
that relies on their data.

The Docker image also contains R, Bioconductor packages and RNAhybrid, each
distributed under its own licence. The bundled JavaScript library
vis-network is distributed under its own licence; see web/vendor/.
